    "created_at": "2016-02-08T23:05:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-08T23:05:37Z",
    "body": "Anyway, I'm particularly interested in what it is _exactly_ that Blink does here, and whether it's limited to data: URIs or also happens for other URIs... and if so for which ones. \n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
